'''Centre Cívico''' ({{Literal translation|Civic Center}}) is an underground [[W:Metro station|station]] of the [[Castejón Metro]] serving the [[Centre Cívico|eponymous barrio]] on the [[Castejón Metro Cartajima Line|Cartajima]] line, located in the [[Sástago]] borough of the [[Castejón Metropolis]]. 

